{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50298","headline":"临水闻雁 · 佚名","name":"临水闻雁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"□来临水吊愁容，忽覩愁容泪满胸。\n肝胆隳离凡几度，云山阻□况千重。\n（阙字，项补「隔」。\n）心殊语异情难识，东步西驰意不从。\n覊绁只今肠自断，更闻哀雁叫噰噰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}